1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,820
Speaking, task four. Situation number 8. The examiner describes a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:18,321
We want to do something healthy together. What shall we do? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:29,026
We could do yoga together.

4
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:30,441
Yoga is boring.

5
00:00:30,733 --> 00:00:32,369
Then let's go for walks.

6
00:00:32,667 --> 00:00:34,291
I don't have time for walks.

7
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,082
Then let's eat healthily.

8
00:00:36,367 --> 00:00:37,813
And why do you want this?

9
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,502
Because we can do it every day and we don't need extra time for it.

10
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,372
OK, we'll eat healthily.

11
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:52,768
Practise situation 8 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
